name: Erratic Jack Spike — many Jacks
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Jacks, a 25% face-card rank spike for
  Photograph, Sock and Buskin, Smiley Face, and Hit the Road. RAG aliases: erratic jacks,
  many Jacks, face-card pile, discard Jacks, PhotoChad setup.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Jack
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: HitTheRoad
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 50
  - joker: Photograph
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SockAndBuskin
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: SmileyFace
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
